{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2021-04-15 12:02:00', 'title': 'PPL CORPORATION SHOWCASES ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE INITIATIVES IN ANNUAL SUSTAINABILITY REPORT', 'text': "ALLENTOWN, PA., APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) PUBLISHED ITS ANNUAL SUSTAINABILITY REPORT TODAY, HIGHLIGHTING THE COMPANY'S PROGRESS AND APPROACH ON A WIDE RANGE OF ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE INITIATIVES, INCLUDING CLIMATE STRATEGY, ELECTRIFICIATION GOALS, COVID-19 RESPONSE AND DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION COMMITMENTS."}